## Implementation Matches Official Documentation

According to the official Vercel Speed Insights documentation fetched from https://vercel.com/docs/speed-insights/quickstart:

**For React/Vite projects**, the recommended setup is:
```typescript
import { SpeedInsights } from '@vercel/speed-insights/react';

export default function App() {
  return (
    <div>
      {/* content */}
      <SpeedInsights />
    </div>
  );
}
```

**This project's implementation** matches this pattern exactly, with the component placed at the root level of the application.

